  dir_copydll_err_path.pcpp - break step of dir_copydll.pcpp: a path no file
  can have (a '<' in it: it cannot even be resolved, so it is not looked for)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_copydll_err_path.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_copydll_err_path.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe dir_copydll_err_path;
@copydll "lib<1.dll"; // ERROR PR0022@10: cannot be resolved

begin
end.
